## 3. OFFICE PLAY FLOW (end to end)

1. A player opens the link and clicks **Create Room**. They get a code like `KQTR` and an **invite link** (`https://.../?room=KQTR`). Anyone opening the link lands on Join with the code filled in.
2. Friends join. In the **Lobby** each picks a tank color and style, and clicks **Ready**.
3. The **host** picks mode, map, map size, rules (all with live previews, Section 16) and clicks **Start**.
4. Loading screen (map generation + tips), pre-match plan screen (mode objective + controls reminder), 3-2-1 countdown, battle.
5. Match end: results screen with podium, stats and awards. **Rematch** keeps the same settings. Players can leave or join between matches.
6. If the host leaves, the earliest-joined player becomes host. If a player disconnects, they can rejoin within 60 s with the same tank and score.
7. **Practice mode:** one player vs bots, runs fully in the browser with no server, to learn the controls and test tank feel.

