## 6. COMBAT RULES

- **Server authoritative:** the server decides every hit, damage, pickup, kill and score. Clients only send inputs.
- Damage is applied to HP. At 0 HP the tank is destroyed (Section 12). Damage numbers float above hit tanks.
- Friendly fire is OFF in team modes. Own explosive barrels and mines can hurt you.
- **Kills, deaths, assists** (damage in the last 5 s before an enemy died, not the killer), damage dealt, accuracy, power-ups collected, best streak are tracked.
- **Streak banners:** 3 = "Triple!", 5 = "Rampage!", 7 = "Unstoppable!", 10 = "Legend!".
- **Spawn rules:** a spawn point is chosen that is at least 40 m from enemies and not in an enemy's view cone; in team modes near teammates.
- **Anti-camping:** a very strong "lock-on" is not given; instead spawn shield (2 s) and random spawn selection prevent spawn camping.
- **Destructible objects:** wooden crate (30 HP, breaks), explosive barrel (red, 20 HP, explosion radius 6 m, 40 damage, chains), cracked wall segments (60 HP) on some maps.
- **Hazards:** none cause instant death; ice and mud only change movement.

