| # | Weapon | Uses | How it works | Damage | Counterplay |
|---|---|---|---|---|---|
| 1 | **Homing Missile** | 1 | Launches forward, curves toward the nearest enemy within a 60-degree front cone and 90 m (turn rate 80 degrees/s, speed 32 m/s, lifetime 4 s). Red lock-on ring on the target. | 45, small blast 2 m | Turn sharply, break line of sight behind walls, shoot it (it has 10 HP) |
| 2 | **Cluster Missile** | 1 | Flies to the aim pin (max 70 m), explodes in the air and drops **5 bomblets** in a 6 m circle. | 18 each (max 54 if all hit) | Move out of the warning circle |
| 3 | **Guided Missile** | 1 | While it flies (max 4 s) the camera follows the missile and the player steers it with the mouse. The tank is vulnerable and cannot move meanwhile. Detonate with the fire key. | 50, blast 3 m | Hit the owner while vulnerable |
| 4 | **Bouncing Shell** | 3 shots | Heavy shell that ricochets up to 3 times, leaves a short fire trail. | 35 | Use cover angles |
| 5 | **EMP Pulse** | 1 | Short-range blast (radius 15 m): enemy tanks are slowed to 50% for 3 s, shields removed, their stored weapon is disabled for 3 s. | 0 | Stay away |
| 6 | **Mines** | 3 | Drop behind the tank. Armed after 1 s, hidden from enemies after 2 s (visible to owner and team as a blinking light). | 50, radius 3 m | Scout; shoot a mine to detonate it early |
