## 8. POWER BOXES

**Power Boxes** are glowing crates floating on fixed **pads** on the map. A tank collects one by driving over it. Boxes respawn **20 s** after pickup. The server decides who gets it (if two tanks arrive at the same time, the earliest server time wins).

**Look:** neon-outlined cube with a "?" symbol, rotating and bobbing, a beam of light going up (visible from far), a pulsing ring on the ground. Pickup: sparkle burst + chime + the power-up name and icon pop up on the HUD for 2 s. Pads show on the minimap as cube icons; a small timer shows when a box is respawning.

**Rules:** 8 to 14 pads per map (more on bigger maps). The box type is random by weight when it respawns. If the tank already holds a stored weapon, a stored-weapon box still replaces it (a small "swap" icon shows).

| Type | Item | Effect | Weight |
|---|---|---|---|
| Timed | **Repair Kit** (instant) | +40 HP | 18 |
| Timed | **Shield** (6 s) | Blue bubble absorbs 50 damage | 10 |
| Timed | **Rapid Fire** (8 s) | Reload x0.4 | 10 |
| Timed | **Triple Shot** (8 s) | Cannon fires 3 shells in a 14-degree fan | 8 |
| Timed | **Speed Boost** (6 s) | Speed x1.4 and instant turbo refill | 8 |
| Timed | **Damage Up** (8 s) | Cannon damage x1.6 | 6 |
| Stored | Homing Missile | see Section 7 | 8 |
| Stored | Cluster Missile | | 7 |
| Stored | Guided Missile | | 4 |
| Stored | Bouncing Shell | | 7 |
| Stored | EMP Pulse | | 5 |
| Stored | Mines | | 5 |
| Stored | Airstrike | | 4 |

Timed effects: same type refreshes the timer; different types can run together. They show as small icons with shrinking rings above the health bar, and as colored auras on the tank.

