## 9. GAME MODES (each plays differently)

The host picks the mode first. The map list then shows recommended maps for that mode first (others are still selectable). A **mode card** shows a 2-line "how to win" plan and a tip.

1. **Free For All (FFA)** - Plan: grab Power Boxes, avoid getting surrounded, hunt weak tanks. First to **15 kills** or highest kills after **8:00**. Respawn on. Recommended maps: Desert Outpost, Industrial Yard, Frozen Lake, Forest Maze.
2. **Team Deathmatch (TDM)** - Red vs Blue (auto-balanced; host can move players). Friendly fire off. First team to **30 kills** or higher after **10:00**. Respawn near teammates. Recommended: Industrial Yard, Desert Outpost, Twin Bases.
3. **Last Tank Standing (LTS)** - No respawn. Best of 5 rounds (first to 3). A **safe zone ring** shrinks slowly after 30 s to force fights; outside the ring a tank takes 5 damage per second. Dead players spectate. Recommended: Frozen Lake, Forest Maze, Crater Hill.
4. **Capture the Flag (CTF)** - Each team has a flag at its base. Carry the enemy flag to your own base while your flag is home to score. The carrier is slowed by 15%, cannot use turbo, and is marked on the minimap for everyone. A dropped flag returns after 15 s or when touched by its team. First to **3 captures** or most after **12:00**. Recommended map: **Twin Bases**.
5. **King of the Hill (KOTH)** - A glowing zone (radius 10 m) appears at one of 5 spots and moves every **45 s**. Standing alone in the zone (or only your team) gives **1 point per second**. Contested = no points. First to **120 points** or highest after **10:00**. Recommended map: **Crater Hill**.

**Common host options:** map, map size (Small, Medium, Large), time limit, score limit, Power Boxes on/off, bots (0 to 8) and difficulty, friendly fire (teams), tank rule (Classic = everyone Standard / Classes = players pick, Section 28), tank HP (100/150, Classic only), shrinking zone toggle (FFA/TDM), private password.
**Tie rule:** sudden death (next kill/score wins, max 60 s, then draw).
**Objective banner** at start: e.g. "Capture the enemy flag!", plus a live objective marker on the HUD.

